WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.932
Name the five automation levels,

3
00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:08.287
and set each device group's
level to the response ladder.

4
00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:13.147
Record attack disruption exclusions for
emergency access and service accounts,

5
00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:15.649
with the authorizing official's approval.

6
00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:19.538
Run the monthly evidence run, and
check its hashes a month later.

7
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:23.264
And use the synthetic events,
the metrics and the evidence

8
00:00:23.264 --> 00:00:27.301
catalog to show that the controls
work, not just that they exist.

9
00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:29.062
You need Modules 1 to 4.

10
00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:33.160
Skim the Security Operations
and Telemetry book's Chapter 11,

11
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.937
for the response ladder, and
Chapter 12, for the metric set.

12
00:00:36.937 --> 00:00:40.370
Lab 2 runs in a test
tenant, never production.
